{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KZ.GLnResidues","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZPentagon","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZHexagon","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Matrix"],"declarations":19,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.pentagon_drinfeld_gln","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.pentagon_drinfeld_gln","kind":"theorem","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L225-L239","doc":"**The KZ pentagon for `𝔤𝔩_n` in Drinfeld's coproduct form**, on `V^{⊗4}`, `ℏ ∉ ℚ`:\n`Φ^{234} Φ^{1,23,4} Φ^{123} = Φ^{1,2,34} Φ^{12,3,4}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_smul_P_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_smul_P_add","kind":"theorem","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L216-L223","doc":"Non-resonance of `ℏ (P_{ij} + P_{kl})` for two flips satisfying the braid relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.hexagon_gln","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.hexagon_gln","kind":"theorem","line":195,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L195-L214","doc":"**The KZ hexagon for `𝔤𝔩_n` on `V^{⊗3}`.** For `ℏ ∉ ℚ`, `A = ℏ P₁₂`, `B = ℏ P₂₃`,\n`C = −A − B`: `e^{−iπA} Φ(C,A) e^{−iπC} Φ(B,C) e^{−iπB} Φ(A,B) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_C","kind":"theorem","line":185,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L185-L193","doc":"The three-point residues `A = ℏ P₁₂`, `B = ℏ P₂₃` and `C = −A − B` on `V^{⊗3}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.pentagon_gln","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.pentagon_gln","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L170-L183","doc":"**The KZ pentagon for `𝔤𝔩_n` on `V^{⊗4}`.** For `ℏ ∉ ℚ` and `t_{ij} = ℏ P_{ij}`,\n`Φ(T₂₃₄, t₁₂) Φ(t₂₃, t₃₄) Φ(T₁₂₃, T₂₃₄) Φ(t₁₂, t₂₃) Φ(t₃₄, T₁₂₃) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_T234","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_T234","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L156-L162","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_T123","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_T123","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L148-L154","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_smul_P","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_smul_P","kind":"theorem","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L143-L146","doc":"Non-resonance of a single residue `ℏ P_{ij}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.P_mul_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.P_mul_self","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L141-L141","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.kzRes_rel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.kzRes_rel","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L122-L137","doc":"**The infinitesimal pure-braid relations** for `t_{ij} = ℏ P_{ij}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.commute_P_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.commute_P_add","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L114-L120","doc":"`[P_{ij}, P_{kl} + P_{k'l'}] = 0` when conjugation by `(ij)` swaps `(kl)` and `(k'l')`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.commute_P","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.commute_P","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L107-L112","doc":"`[P_{ij}, P_{kl}] = 0` from an equality of permutations. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.kzRes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.kzRes","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L99-L105","doc":"The four-point `𝔤𝔩_n` KZ residues `t_{ij} = ℏ P_{ij}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.smul_casimirLeg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.smul_casimirLeg","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L94-L97","doc":"The residues are the split Casimir tensors: `ℏ t_{ij} = ℏ P_{ij}` for `i ≠ j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.P_mul_P","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.P_mul_P","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L88-L92","doc":"Relations among flips: the equality of two products of flips reduces to an equality of\npermutations. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.P","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.P","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L85-L86","doc":"The flip `P_{ij}` on `V^{⊗m}` over `ℂ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.Mat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.Mat","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L82-L83","doc":"`End(V^{⊗m})`, `V = ℂⁿ`, as matrices indexed by `Fin m → Fin n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_smul_sum_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_smul_sum_two","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L55-L70","doc":"`c (a + b)` is non-resonant for two involutions with `aba = bab`, whenever `c ∉ ℚ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_smul_sum_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.GLnKZ.nonResonant_smul_sum_three","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/GLnKZ.lean#L37-L53","doc":"`c (a + b + c')` is non-resonant for three involutions with the `S₃` conjugation relations,\nwhenever `c ∉ ℚ`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}